flowchart LR
    GH[GitHub GraphQL API] --> AD[Integration Adapter<br/>github.py]
    AD --> SY[Background Sync Worker<br/>incremental, high-water marks]
    SY --> DB[(SQLite<br/>canonical WorkItem + ActivityEvent)]
    DB --> ME[Metrics Engine<br/>committers, reviewers, mergers, closers,<br/>time-to-merge, stale PRs]
    ME --> SD[Signal Detector<br/>current vs previous window,<br/>review concentration, bus factor<br/>+ facts table]
    SD --> IS[Insight Synthesizer<br/>Claude → structured JSON]
    IS --> CV[Claim Verifier<br/>every cited number checked<br/>against the facts table]
    CV --> API[FastAPI<br/>/metrics /signals /insights<br/>/feedback /calibration]
    API --> UI[React + TS UI<br/>date picker, signal cards,<br/>evidence chain, verdicts]
    IS -.-> TR[LLM Trace Log<br/>prompt version, tokens,<br/>latency, cost]
    UI -.-> FB[Feedback + calibration<br/>Brier score per prompt version]